      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO SECOND CHANCE (4) had been in super honest form hitting the frame five times on end before finishing fourth (25.29) at Gunnedah last time. Should bounce back. RED ROCK BLOOM (7) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 3 lengths into third (18.65) at this track in a Grade 5 over 318m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Will give a great sight again. FOG HOLLOW (1) scored two back in one of the fastest times on the card then was always well back and could manage only a 7 length 7th at Lithgow (18.19) latest. Can do much better this time. MISSY MISCHIEF (3) should be thereabouts.",
